   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two pasts in a story",
     "texto": [
      "If you tell something in the Präteritum and something else happened earlier, the earlier one goes in the **Plusquamperfekt**: **Als ich ankam, hatte die Sitzung schon begonnen** (when I arrived, the meeting had already started). The Präteritum marks the main action; the Plusquamperfekt marks what happened before."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "als",
     "texto": [
      "**Als** is used for a single moment in the past: **Als ich ankam** (when I arrived). After «als», the verb goes at the end. Watch out: **wenn** is used for the present or for something that always happens: **Wenn ich komme** (when I arrive)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
